        {
          "text": "Mesa wakayishihanzi yehina dakujika nachu, niinoriu wakadishi kukabeta katabanaka kakuchidiilu dakaditali mesu namesa, mesa wakayishi kumutamba wakukabetakaku chimunswa. ",
