              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakatuŋi ihina dakukudika muchisu chetenti, dawuzeeli, nawusombu, nawanda wuchinana nge, nawanda wawuwahi wakushinta, mudimu wamukwakuchi manakusowashana. ",
